{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"3021010010030","name":"小糸","text":"お、お待たせ……！","trans":"久、久等啦……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010050","name":"小糸","text":"ごめんね、遅くなっちゃって……\r\n雛菜ちゃんは……？","trans":"对不起，我来晚了……\n雏菜呢……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010100","name":"円香","text":"ふわ……","trans":"呼啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010110","name":"小糸","text":"ね、眠そうだね\r\nお疲れ様……！","trans":"好、好像很困呢\n辛苦了……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010130","name":"円香","text":"小糸が来るまで\r\n…………少し寝てた","trans":"在小糸来之前\n…………稍微睡了一会儿","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010140","name":"小糸","text":"そ、そうなの？\r\n寝不足……？","trans":"是、是这样吗？\n睡眠不足……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010150","name":"小糸","text":"か、帰って休んだほうが……","trans":"还、还是回去休息比较……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010160","name":"円香","text":"……大丈夫\r\n課題の続き、やらないと","trans":"……没事\n作业不接着做不行","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010170","name":"小糸","text":"う、うん……\r\n無理しないでね……！","trans":"嗯、嗯……\n别太勉强自己哦……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010180","name":"円香","text":"────パチパチと","trans":"────噼啪噼啪地","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010190","name":"円香","text":"爆ぜる音","trans":"爆开的声音","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010210","name":"小糸","text":"……あ………………","trans":"……啊………………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010220","name":"円香","text":"……アイス、買ってきた","trans":"……冰淇淋，我买来了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010230","name":"小糸","text":"あっ、おかえり……！","trans":"啊，欢迎回来……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010240","name":"円香","text":"食べていいよ\r\nひとつ","trans":"可以吃哦\n拿一个","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010250","name":"円香","text":"トリプルだから","trans":"因为是三球的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010270","name":"小糸","text":"な、何味……？","trans":"是、是什么味道……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010280","name":"円香","text":"……\r\nなんだっけ……","trans":"……\n是什么来着……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010290","name":"円香","text":"まあ、小糸の好きな味","trans":"嘛，是小糸喜欢的味道","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010300","name":"小糸","text":"……！\r\nほ、ほんと……！","trans":"……！\n真、真的……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010320","name":"小糸","text":"……ん……！","trans":"……嗯……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010330","name":"小糸","text":"おいしい……！","trans":"好好吃……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010350","name":"円香","text":"小糸、頑張ってるから","trans":"因为小糸一直在努力","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010370","name":"円香","text":"頑張ったところで、\r\nかならず結果が出るわけじゃないけど","trans":"虽然努力了\n也不一定会有结果","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010380","name":"円香","text":"頑張ったことは事実だから","trans":"但努力过是事实","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010390","name":"円香","text":"ご褒美","trans":"奖励","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010410","name":"小糸","text":"じゃ、じゃあ、お返し……！","trans":"那、那作为回礼……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010420","name":"小糸","text":"ポテト……！\r\n円香ちゃんも","trans":"薯条……！\n圆香也一起吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010430","name":"小糸","text":"寝不足になるくらい……\r\n何か、頑張ってたんだよね……？","trans":"困到睡眠不足的地步……\n一定是在努力做什么吧……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010450","name":"円香","text":"……や、アイスあるから","trans":"……不用了，有冰淇淋","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010460","name":"小糸","text":"……！\r\nそ、そっか……","trans":"……！\n原、原来是这样……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010470","name":"小糸","text":"あ……","trans":"啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010480","name":"小糸","text":"そういえば\r\nこの間、大丈夫だった……？","trans":"说起来\n之前那件事，没事吧……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010500","name":"小糸","text":"事務所……\r\n行ってみたんでしょ？","trans":"事务所……\n你去看了吧？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010510","name":"円香","text":"……事務所？","trans":"……事务所？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010520","name":"小糸","text":"……？\r\nあの、名刺にあった事務所……","trans":"……？\n就是，名片上那个事务所……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010530","name":"円香","text":"……名刺？　なんの","trans":"……名片？　什么的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010550","name":"小糸","text":"た、確か、名前……\r\nえっと……","trans":"好、好像是，名字……\n那个……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010560","name":"小糸","text":"２８３プロダクションっていう────────","trans":"说是叫283事务所────────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010570","name":"円香","text":"────ゆっくりと","trans":"────缓缓地","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3021010010580","name":"円香","text":"煙が生まれる、匂い","trans":"烟雾诞生的，气味","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}